1318 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Hack Club \nProgram Lead\054 Engineer \046 Designer \050Gap Year\051\nHack Club is a 501\050c\051\0503\051 nonprofit and a network of 100\054000\053 high schoolers in 119 countries\056\nCore engineering and design team for Stardance\054 a global online engineering challenge for teens\056 Ran in partnership with NASA\054 AMD\054 and Github\054 grew to 30\054000\053 signups\056\nSolo designed and built Milkyway\054 an online game development challenge with 3\054000 signups and 200 daily active users\056 Designed tshirts\054 jackets\054 stickers for production\056 Cumulated in Overglade\054 an in\055person hackathon in Singapore for 50 teens globally\056\nRedesigned hackclub\056com homepage\054 the organisation\031s main public\055facing page\056\nRepresented Hack Club at GDC Festival of Gaming 2026\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1319 0 R
     /Pg 1312 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
