  << /ActualText (Apple\054 Swift Accelerator Programme \niOS App Development Mentor\nSwift Accelerator Programme is a tech talent development program by Apple and Tinkercademy\056\nRan weekly mentoring sessions for students to design\054 debug\054 and publish apps on the App Store\056\nInvited by Apple Singapore to speak at student events and present projects to senior leadership\056)
